<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Thornburg Mortgage.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Thornburg Mortgage.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said it initiated coverage of Thornburg Mortgage Asset Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month target of $26.50.</p>
<p>-- said Thornburg currently trades at a discount to other mortgage real estate investment trusts (REITs).</p>
<p>-- said Thornburg &quot;represents an excellent income producing equity with strong growth potential.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said company's new plan to raise equity on a quarterly basis could accelerate earnings per share growth.</p>
<p>-- Thornburg gained 5/8 to 21-3/4.</p>
</text>
